  "sangamTamil": "கழுநீருள் காரட கேனும் ஒருவன்\nவிழுமிதாக் கொள்ளின் அமிழ்தாம் - விழுமிய\nகுய்த்துவையார் வெண்சோறே யாயினும் மேவாதார்\nகைத்துண்டல் காஞ்சிரங் காய்.",
  "urai": null,
  "english": "A dinner of herbs with affection is ambrosia. The greatest delicacies without it, nux vomica. If one receive you courteously, though what he gives is but rank herbs dressed in water in which rice had been washed, it is ambrosia. To eat from the hands of those who love us not, though it be white rice with rich spicy condiments, is nux vomica.",
